Cherry Studio source notice
---------------------------

Portions of the settings information architecture, visual structure, and
provider/model workflows are adapted from Cherry Studio:

  Project: Cherry Studio
  Upstream: https://github.com/CherryHQ/cherry-studio
  Baseline: 13687df354e9845c7e2b6d155eac6a9171f6a533
  Application version: 2.0.7
  License: GNU Affero General Public License, version 3

The adapted code replaces Cherry Studio's Electron IPC, Preference, DataApi,
WindowManager, TanStack Router, Tailwind, and @cherrystudio/ui dependencies with
DSH Host/Client RPC, slot composition, CSS Modules, semantic tokens, and DSH UI
primitives. The exact source-to-destination inventory is maintained in
provenance/cherry-source-inventory.json.

